<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{updateNotice}}" class="card section">{{updateNotice}}</view>
  <view class="card section">
    <view class="h">MARD 色卡</view>
    <radio-group bindchange="setPaletteVersion">
      <label class="radio-item"><radio value="221" checked="{{paletteVersion==='221'}}" />221 色标准版</label>
      <label class="radio-item"><radio value="291" checked="{{paletteVersion==='291'}}" />291 色完整版（含扩展色）</label>
    </radio-group>
    <view>按手头套装选择；屏幕颜色仅供参考。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card section">
    <view class="h">预计成品尺寸</view>
    <view>{{sizeLabel}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card section">
    <view class="h">选择颗粒网格</view>
    <view class="chips">
      <view wx:for="{{gridOptions}}" wx:key="value" class="chip {{!customGrid && grid === item.value ? 'chip-active' : ''}}" data-value="{{item.value}}" bindtap="setGrid">{{item.label}}</view>
      <view class="chip {{customGrid ? 'chip-active' : ''}}" data-value="custom" bindtap="setGrid">自定义</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{customGrid}}" class="custom-grid">
      <input type="number" value="{{customSize}}" placeholder="每边格数（1～1000）" bindinput="setCustomSize" />
      <view>正方形网格，最大 1000×1000 格。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="grid-hint">大尺寸转换和 Excel 导出需要更长时间；细节色号请在 Excel 中放大查看。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card section">
    <view class="h">最多使用：{{colorCount}}色</view>
    <view>自动合并相近颜色、减少杂色，适合卡通和插画；实际用色可能少于上限。</view>
    <slider min="8" max="{{maxColorCount}}" step="1" value="{{colorCount}}" activeColor="#ff8fbe" block-color="#ffd0e4" bindchange="setColorCount" />
  </view>

  <view class="card section preview-box">
    <view class="h">预览</view>
    <view class="radio-item"><switch checked="{{trimWhite}}" bindchange="setTrimWhite" />自动裁掉四周白边</view>
    <view>保留主体内的白色，只裁掉外围整行、整列的白色空边；用豆量按裁剪后计算。</view>
    <image src="{{imagePath}}" mode="aspectFit" class="preview" />
  </view>

  <button class="primary-btn next" bindtap="startConvert">开始转换</button>
</view>
